---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Prose from '../../components/Prose.astro';
import { localizedPath } from '../../i18n';

// The Company page (LW-74). Wording approved by the founder on 2026-11-17;
// the Turkish page is written separately, not translated (DESIGN.md
// section 9). The founder is named here, in two factual sentences, and
// nowhere else on the site: no photo, no story, no employer names.
---

<BaseLayout
  locale="en"
  title="Company — Luvita"
  description="Luvita turns new science and technology into tools people work with: Umay, Nesili and the CosmoCrew apps."
  paths={{ tr: 'hakkimizda', en: 'about' }}
>
  <section class="container company-page">
    <h1>We turn new science and technology into tools people work with.</h1>

    <Prose>
      <p>
        Luvita makes software products and keeps them running. Each one takes
        something that research or new technology has made possible and turns
        it into a tool a person or a company can use every day. Umay, in
        development, brings AI to customer service calls in natural Turkish.
        Nesili, in pilot, masks what a team does not want to send out
        (personal details, customer and file numbers and the like) before
        their text reaches an AI tool; the raw details stay on their own
        computer. The CosmoCrew apps SliceFocus and LexiPower build on
        research into focus and memory.
      </p>
      <p>
        We will know it has worked when what we build is so much a part of
        people&rsquo;s days that they would miss it the morning it was gone.
      </p>
      <p>
        Luvita was founded in 2026 by
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/merty-ertugrul/" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mert Ertuğrul</a>. Before
        that he worked for more than a decade in banking and finance, in
        Istanbul and London.
      </p>
      <p>
        The products, and where each one stands today, are on the
        <a href={localizedPath('en')}>home page</a>.
      </p>
    </Prose>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .company-page {
    padding-block: var(--sp-5) var(--sp-6);
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: var(--fs-hero);
    line-height: var(--lh-snug);
    max-width: 26ch;
    margin-block: var(--sp-4) var(--sp-6);
  }
</style>
